      "name": "The Armoured Anvil",
      "flavor": "On Nocturne even the tanks are tempered twice.",
      "text": "Armour and Transport vehicles (other than Flyers) gain +1 Hull Point, but each costs 10 points more for the extra plate. No drops from orbit and no jump infantry: nothing with the Antigrav type and no Drop Pods, Dreadclaws or Kharybdis. At least two Armour units are required.",
